# Page rules

- New pages live under `src/presentation/pages/{FeatureName}/` (PascalCase folder).
- Wire a route in `src/presentation/mainFiles/App.tsx`.
- Default: wrap with `PrivateRoute` unless the human explicitly wants a public route.
- Match nearby UI stack: MUI + Tailwind + existing layout (Sidebar shell).
- Do not delete `* copy*` / `*Backup*` / `*Golden*` siblings unless asked.
- If some similar pages use PrivateRoute and some do not, **ask** before choosing for a new route.
- Empty/scaffold pages: no fake ApiSlice unless requested.
- After adding a page/route, note update for `docs/ai-context/frontend.md` / Graphify when structural.
